//RS //! Checked filesystem authority for package and workspace metadata.
//RS //!
//RS //! Every authority-sensitive reader goes through this module.  The resolver
//RS //! opens the root once, walks descendants without following links, keeps the
//RS //! opened object and its identity in the returned snapshot, and checks the
//RS //! pathname again before a caller uses the snapshot.
